description: Ringo core architecture invariants
globs:
  - "src/**/*.py"
  - "tests/**/*.py"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Ringo Core Rules

1. Keep runtime flow on-graph via nodes.
2. Keep node/service/store boundaries explicit.
3. No silent fallback routing.
4. No direct transport calls from business services.
5. Keep message contracts deterministic and serializable.

If change touches control-plane/lifecycle:
- add or update targeted tests
- run control-plane/lifecycle pytest suites
